WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Research timelapse at 40 times real speed. Upper surface: 50 degrees; lower: 90 degrees.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
On the steeper surface, stationary ants accumulate into a living scaffold.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.040
Other ants cross over the scaffold. The footage shows a sloping platform, not an open-gap bridge.
